// A field on a kind that does not declare it. TONE belongs to FEEDBACK and
// PERSPECTIVE to WORLD_VIEW; written on a SCREEN, each is read by nothing and
// does nothing, and the author believes the tone and the vantage are honoured.
// Both values here are lawful ones, so INVALID_TONE and INVALID_PERSPECTIVE stay
// quiet and the fixture isolates the placement. ROLE on the wrong kind is
// ROLE_MISPLACED's, and is not repeated here.
// Expected: FIELD_MISPLACED

DEFINE SCREEN overdue_invoices (
  SATISFIES [SCAN, COMPARE],
  TONE cautionary,
  PERSPECTIVE top_down
)
